{
  "dom_id": "step-472299",
  "name": "Example: \n                    Determining the Multiplicity of a Root of a Cubic Polynomial Using Synthetic Division",
  "problem": "What is the multiplicity of the root $x=-3$ in the polynomial $p(x) = 2x^3 + 13x^2 + 24x + 9?$",
  "worked_solution": "Since $x=-3$ is a root of $p(x),$ the factor theorem tells us that $(x+3)$ is a factor of $p(x).$\n\nBecause $(x+3)$ is a factor of $p(x),$ we know that $(x+3)$ divides $p(x)$ with no remainder. So, to begin factoring $p(x),$ we can divide it by $(x+3)$ using synthetic division:\n\n|  | $x^3$ | $x^2$ | $x^1$ | $x^0$ |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| $\\color{red}-3$ | $2$ | $13$ | $24$ | $9$ |\n|  | $\\color{gray}\\downarrow$ | $-6$ | $-21$ | $-9$ |\n|  | $2$ | $7$ | $3$ | $0$ |\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\dfrac{p(x)}{x+3} = 2x^2 + 7x + 3\n$$\n\nwhich means that\n\n$$\np(x) = (x+3) (2x^2 + 7x + 3).\n$$\n\nWe can factor the quadratic factor even further, and get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}p(x) & =(x+3)(2x+1)(x+3) \\\\  & =(x+3)^{2}(2x+1).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe factor $(x+3)$ has an exponent of $2$ in the factored form of $p(x).$ So the root $x=-3$ has multiplicity $2.$",
  "calculator_instructions": "",
  "fields": [],
  "problem_field_keys": [],
  "answer_fields_complete": null,
  "result": null,
  "proof_feedback": null,
  "html": "<div id=\"step-472299\" class=\"step\" style=\"display: block\" stepid=\"472299\" steptype=\"example\" contentid=\"12995\">\n            <div class=\"stepHeader\">\n                <div class=\"stepName\">\n                    Example: \n                    <a id=\"stepAnchor-472299\" class=\"stepAnchor\" style=\"font-weight: normal;\" name=\"step-5\">Determining the Multiplicity of a Root of a Cubic Polynomial Using Synthetic Division</a> \n                </div>      \n                <div class=\"helpButton\" stepid=\"472299\">?</div>\n            </div>\n            \n            <div class=\"exampleQuestion\">\n                <style type=\"text/css\">\n                            .mjpage .MJX-monospace {\n                            font-family: monospace\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage .MJX-sans-serif {\n                            font-family: sans-serif\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage {\n                            display: inline;\n                            font-style: normal;\n                            font-weight: normal;\n                            line-height: normal;\n                            font-size: 100%;\n                            font-size-adjust: none;\n                            text-indent: 0;\n                            text-align: left;\n                            text-transform: none;\n                            letter-spacing: normal;\n                            word-spacing: normal;\n                            word-wrap: normal;\n                            white-space: nowrap;\n                            float: none;\n                            direction: ltr;\n                            max-width: none;\n                            max-height: none;\n                            min-width: 0;\n                            min-height: 0;\n                            border: 0;\n                            padding: 0;\n                